557
01:05:02,100 --> 01:05:05,497
<i>I hope you choose something
you truly want to do.</i>

558
01:05:05,497 --> 01:05:08,008
<i>Does my history with CEO Kang bother you?</i>

559
01:05:08,008 --> 01:05:11,209
<i>I trust the person I'm with.</i>

560
01:05:11,209 --> 01:05:12,268
<i>Do you?</i>

561
01:05:12,268 --> 01:05:13,331
<i>What do you mean?</i>

562
01:05:13,331 --> 01:05:17,854
<i>Because now I want Ha Gi back.</i>

563
01:05:17,854 --> 01:05:21,529
<i>Were you with her this whole time?</i>

